improvements with a fail fast mentality.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Be a proactive sharer of compelling ideas/work to the rest of the team and organisation. We want you to help lead/push the adoption of AI throughout 9fin.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>What Makes This Role Different</strong></h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">This role is focused on converting complex financial and legal documents into structured, reliable data. While experience with chatbots, retrieval systems, and general-purpose AI applications is valuable, the core challenge is building systems that can accurately understand legal documentation and extract the information that powers financial analysis and workflow automation.</p><h2><strong>About You</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">This role will be a great fit if you:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Legal Document Intelligence</strong>: Deep experience working with complex legal and financial documents, including bond offering memoranda, credit agreements, indentures, court filings, and related transaction documentation.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Information Extraction</strong>: Expertise in extracting structured data from long, complex documents, including financial terms, covenant provisions, definitions, parties, dates, thresholds, baskets, ratios, and transaction mechanics.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Document Understanding &amp; NLP</strong>: Strong understanding of document structure, section hierarchy, cross-references, defined terms, tables, exhibits, and other patterns common in legal and financial documentation.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>LLMs for Structured Extraction</strong>: Experience applying LLMs to high-precision extraction tasks, including schema-driven extraction, citation grounding, validation, and confidence scoring.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Data Quality &amp; Validation Systems</stro