&lt;li&gt;Oversee execution of earned media strategy for multiple clients and accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain strong relationships with clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain strong relationships with journalists and key contacts within UK, European and Global media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the quality of the media team is held to the highest standard and that all client requests are handled in a strategic and timely manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with account leads to run and grow integrated business and to develop new business opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Directly supervise part of the media team and promote continuous learning and development to help build a high performing culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a health PR agency, as an Associate Director, Director or Senior Account Director looking to step up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience and/or specialism within Earned Media and Media Strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable relationships with the key trade and national press&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with pharma/biotech/med tech clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work within cross-functional teams internally in order to deliver outstanding client work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to support and drive new business operations alone and as part of bigger team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry is proud to be Great Place to Work®&amp;nbsp;certified; check out what our people shared about our culture and workplace on our Great Places to Work Profile&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.greatplacetowork.com%2Fcertified-company%2F7038366&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cclehmar%40realchemistry.com%7C1f18aaed4326491b3efc08ddd690f025%7C6fa5bfc4f95843f8bb395d382689654b%7C0%7C0%7C638902640185888156%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=pwvaCn37QXkjVQ0p6u92Oz4FA4j5NQZoNJL0ffy01qs%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
