tions, and ensuring consistency with loads and system requirements.<br><br>· Ability to interpret results critically, identify anomalies, and propose sound engineering solutions.<br><br>· Excellent communication skills—able to articulate assumptions, limitations, and design implications clearly to multidisciplinary teams.<br><br>· Proactive mindset, ownership attitude, and passion for sharing knowledge and elevating team capability.<br><br>· Fluent English.<br><br><strong>Other useful skills</strong><br><br>· Experience in any of the following topics: fatigue (high cycle and low cycle), fracture mechanics, rotodynamics, test-correlation, topology optimization or probabilistic structural methods.<br><br>· Knowledge of rocket propulsion systems: injector heads, thrust chambers, turbomachinery, feed systems, thermal & dynamic environments, etc.<br><br>· Proficiency with meshing tools (e.g., MeshWorks) and scripting languages (Python, MATLAB).<br><br>· Experience writing Abaqus subroutines (UMAT, USDFLD, UEL, etc.).<br><br>· Experience working with ECSS, AIAA and other aerospace structural verification standards.<br><br>Not hitting every requirement? Research suggests that some people tend to hesitate when it comes to job applications if they don't meet all the desired qualifications. Here at Pangea Aerospace, we're committed to fostering a workplace that values diversity, inclusivity, and authenticity. So, if you're enthusiastic about this role but your prior experience doesn't align perfectly with every qualification mentioned in the job description, we still strongly encourage you to apply. You might just be the ideal candidate for this position or other opportunities within our organization.<br><br>More about us…<br><br>We are an international and very multicultural team. Our work is guided by these core values:<br><br>Teamwork: We strive to work together as an aligned team towards our common goals.<br><br>Respect & tolerance: we value people with integrity that treat other people with respect. We enjoy having diverse views to enrich the debate and take better decisions.<br><br>Passion for growth: we are passionate about space and about being pioneers; also, we value personal and organizational growth aiming to a constant improvement.<br><br>Sustainability: because a long-term vision and strategy is not possible if sustainability is not in the team’s core values.<br><br>Daring: we do things that sometimes seem impossible, but we always go the extra mile to find a path to do them and we are ready to take the necessary risks to achieve our goals.<br><br>If this sounds good to you and you want to join the New Space revolution, we really want to meet you!<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/pangea-propulsion/senior-structural-analysis-engineer-toulouse-259241","tags":["Software Development"],"job_types":["professional / experienced"],"location":"Toulouse","created_at":1794247344},{"slug":"responsable-infrastructure-transition-annecy-270370","company_name":"UNEAT","title":"Responsable infrastructure - transition","description":"<p>U.NEAT est une société spécialisée en cybersécurité et propose des services d’expertises à travers ses pôles :</p><ul><li><p>Expertises : assistance technique SecOps / DevSecOps</p></li><li><p>Consulting : activités de conseil en SSI / GRC</p></li><li><p>Cyber Defense Center : service SOC managé et CSIRT</p></li></ul><h2>Vos missions</h2><p>Dans le cadre du pilotage de ses infrastructures IT, notre client recherche un Responsable Infrastructure pour encadrer une équipe pluridisciplinaire intervenant sur les périmètres Datacenters, Réseaux et Télécommunications.</p><p>Le poste couvre à la fois le pilotage opérationnel des infrastructures et la conduite de leurs évolutions.</p><h2>Missions principales</h2><ul><li><p>Manager et animer une équipe technique multi-compétences</p></li><li><p>Piloter le maintien en conditions opérationnelles (RUN / MCO) des infrastructures</p></li><li><p>Garantir la disponibilité, la performance et la fiabilité des environnements</p></li><li><p>Piloter les projets BUILD : conception, déploiement et évolution des infrastructures</p></li><li><p>Coordonner les équipes techniques et les prestataires</p></li><li><p>Gérer les priorités, les ressources et les engagements de service</p></li><li><p>Accompagner la modernisation et l'amélioration continue des infrastructures</p></li></ul><h2>Profil recherché</h2><ul><li><p>Expérience confirmée en management d'équipes infrastructure</p></li><li><p>Maitrise des bonnes pratiques ITIL et expérience en contexte Agile (Kanban / Scrum)</p></li><li><p>Bonne compréhension des environnements Datacenters, Réseaux et Télécoms</p></li><li><p>Expérience du pilotage des activités RUN / MCO et BUILD</p></li><li><p>Capacité à coordonner des équipes pluridisciplinaires et des projets techniques</p></li><li><p>Leadership, organisation et sens du service</p></li></ul><h2>Avantages</h2><ul><li><p>Vous participez au développement d’une entreprise en croissance, spécialiste de la cybersécurité</p></li><li><p>Un parcours RSE et de développement professionnel personnalisé</p></li><li><p>Possibilité d'effectuer 50% du temps en télétravail</p></li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/uneat/responsable-infrastructure-transition-annecy-270370","tags":["System and Network Administration"],"job_types":["Cdi - contrat à durée indéterminée","professionnel / expérimenté"],"location":"Annecy","created_at":1794231095},{"slug":"senior-advertising-sales-manager-france-paris-based-272397","company_name":"Taboola","title":"Senior Advertising Sales Manager, France (Paris based)","description":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Realize your potential by joining the leading performance-driven advertising company!&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The France Enterprise Advertiser team is looking for an eager, results-driven Sales Manager to pursue, negotiate and close deals, bringing in high-profile clients and expanding our footprint in one of the region&#39;s most exciting and fast-moving markets. We&#39;re looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;hunter&lt;/strong&gt;. Someone who doesn&#39;t wait for opportunities to land in their lap, who picks up the phone, gets in the room, and closes. If your instinct is to chase, pitch and win, and you have the track record to prove it, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will identify, engage and cement large brand and performance partnerships, and work with major media agency networks across the region. Displaying a consultative style, you must be an exceptional communicator, comfortable presenting to senior stakeholders across clients and Taboola teams, but make no mistake: this is a sales role, and results are what count.&lt;/p&gt;
