onaangevende vendoren en partners campagnes die er echt toe doen, in de snelgroeiende wereld van cybersecurity.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Bij Nomios werken we aan cybersecurity- en netwerkoplossingen voor organisaties in Nederland en ver daarbuiten. We groeien hard en zoeken een medior marketing specialist die ons team versterkt en onze zichtbaarheid vergroot.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Je werkt veel samen met onze strategische vendoren, partners en de partner manager van Nomios. Samen bedenk je campagnes, rol je ze uit en laat je zien wat ze opleveren. Zo speel je een belangrijke rol in het aantrekken van nieuwe klanten en het versterken van ons partnerecosysteem. Kennis van cybersecurity is geen must; die bouw je bij ons snel op.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#121317">Wat ga je doen?</span></strong></h4><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Als medior marketing specialist ga jij aan de slag met:</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Vendor- en partnermarketing</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Samen met onze strategische vendoren, partners en de partner manager van Nomios bedenk, ontwikkel en voer je gezamenlijke campagnes uit.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Je beheert de marketingactiviteiten met onze vendoren op strategisch, tactisch en operationeel niveau, inclusief planning, marketingfondsen (MDF) en de bijbehorende administratie.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Je rapporteert de resultaten van campagnes aan vendoren, partners en het managementteam en vertaalt die naar verbeteringen.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Campagnes en performance marketing</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Je bedenkt en ontwikkelt digitale (ABM-)campagnes die onze doelgroep raken.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Je beheert en optimaliseert onze Google Ads- en LinkedIn-campagnes.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Content marketing</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Je bedenkt, creëert en publiceert artikelen, video's en andere content, samen met onze experts.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Je optimaliseert bestaande content om vindbaarheid en relevantie te verbeteren.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Social media</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Je werkt mee aan de langetermijnstrategie voor LinkedIn en nieuwe kanalen waar onze doelgroep te vinden is, met als doel meer awareness en groei van ons bereik.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Event marketing</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Je bedenkt, organiseert en voert professionele evenementen uit samen met onze vendoren en partners, waar klanten graag naartoe komen.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Marketing support</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Je ondersteunt het marketingteam bij digitale campagnes binnen de Nomios Groep en draagt bij aan de verbetering van onze website.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Je werkt met tools zoals HubSpot, Canva, Craft CMS, Google Analytics en Google Ads.</span></p></li></ul></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <h4><strong><span style="color:#121317">Wat breng je mee?</span></strong></h4><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Minimaal hbo werk- en denkniveau.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">3 tot 5 jaar werkervaring in (digitale) B2B-marketing.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Ervaring in de IT-branche is zeer wenselijk; ervaring in cybersecurity is een pré, geen must.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Ervaring met vendor- of partnermarketing, bijvoorbeeld met gezamenlijke campagnes en marketingfondsen, is een pré.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Je bouwt makkelijk relaties op met vendoren, partners en collega's. Je bent initiatiefrijk, creatief en resultaatgericht.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Je werkt zelfstandig en nauwkeurig en houdt overzicht over meerdere campagnes tegelijk.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Nederlands is je moedertaal en je beheerst het Engels uitstekend, in woord en geschrift.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Hybride rol: bij voorkeur 3 dagen op kantoor in Zoeterwoude en 2 dagen thuis.</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong><span style="color:#121317">Top, duidelijk. Vertel, waarom Nomios?</span></strong></h4><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Bij Nomios krijg je de vrijheid om je creativiteit en kennis toe te passen binnen een snelgroeiende internationale organisatie. Je werkt met grote, toonaangevende klanten en met de belangrijkste vendoren in cybersecurity en networking. Je zit niet in een uitvoerende rol aan de zijlijn: je bepaalt mee welke campagnes we draaien en ziet direct wat ze opleveren. En er is volop ruimte om te groeien in je rol.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/nomios/marketing-specialist-cybersecurity-leiden-448956","tags":[],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Leiden, Zuid-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1794239494},{"slug":"backend-engineer-payments-team-amsterdam-441218","company_name":"Fastned","title":"Backend Engineer - Payments Team","description":"<p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Join a fast-growing, listed company with a purpose! Fastned owns and operates a network of 400+ fast charging stations across 10 European countries, allowing electric vehicle drivers to charge their car with 100% green energy in just 15 minutes. Our goal is a European network of 1000 fast charging stations in prime locations, where all electric vehicles can charge with renewable energy from the sun and wind. We have recently been voted best charging network in the UK, France and the Netherlands. If you want to make a difference and work in an informal, international scale-up environment with future prospects, then read on!</span></strong></p><h3><strong><span style="color:#121317">Your role</span></strong></h3><p><span style="color:#000000">Fastned aims to accelerate the transition towards sustainable mobility by giving fast charging to electric drivers. Part of that mission is making car charging as simple as charging your phone, and paying for it should be just as effortless. As a Backend Engineer in the Payments team, you will help make paying for a charge frictionless, secure and reliable. Drivers can pay through the Fastned app, by QR code or with a contactless card at the charger.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">The team owns Fastned’s payments domain end to end. That covers integrations with payment service providers and payment terminals. It also covers the services behind payment methods, wallets, pre-authorisation and session payments, billing, invoicing and dunning. The stakes are high: Fastned handles 23,000+ charging sessions a day, and every one of those payments goes through our systems. We’re now moving towards real-time payments, where each session is paid instantly instead of invoiced later. As we are growing and adding roaming features as a Mobility Service Provider, there are many scale relevant challenges to solve.</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">We have no legacy systems. You’ll work with Kotlin 2.x, Java 21+, and Spring Boot 4 on most services, AWS, Kubernetes, Kafka, SQL (Postgres), Terraform, GitLab CI/CD and REST APIs to build scalable, fault-tolerant services that drivers and our Finance team rely on every day. We encourage responsible AI usage and provide tooling like Claude Code, Codex, Dust</span><em><span style="color:#000000">.</span></em><span style="color:#000000">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000">You’ll work closely with the other product teams, alongside fellow Backend Engineers, Data, Design, an Engineering Manager and a Product Manager in a Scrum setup. This role suits an engineer who enjoys a complex domain, cares about getting the details right, and wants to grow by taking real ownership of business-critical systems.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3><strong><span style="color:#121317">Your overall responsibilities include</span></strong></h3><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Designing, developing, testing and reviewing reusable, maintainable and scalable code</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Working AI-first: using AI-augmented engineering, agentic workflows and AI tooling as a natural part of how you design, build, test and review, with judgement for where AI is a multiplier and where humans stay in the loop;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Taking ownership from discovery to post-production;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Taking operational responsibility for what you build, including monitoring, alerting and incident analysis;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Helping improve engineering methodologies and best practices</span></p></li></ul> <br> <h3><strong>